{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"a28d4e9eab522c89","type":"text","text":"### Router\n\n- **Gerät:** AVM Fritz!Box Cable\n- **Schnittstellen:**\n    - 1x **2,5 Gbit/s** Ethernet Port (RJ45)    \n    - 3x **1 Gbit/s** Ethernet Ports (RJ45)\nhttps://fritz.box/\n\n### DNS-Konfiguration (Fritz!Box)\n\n- **Gerät:** AVM Fritz!Box Cable\n- **IP-Adresse:** `192.168.178.1`\n\n- **Einstellungen unter `Heimnetz -> Netzwerk -> Netzwerkeinstellungen`:**\n\n    - **Lokaler DNS-Server (IPv4):** `192.168.178.55`\n    - **Lokaler DNSv6-Server (IPv6):** `fd4f:8ad3:d94b:0:be24:11ff:fe2d:e1f0`","x":-220,"y":-2320,"width":460,"height":500,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"73eb810184da42f6","type":"text","text":"### Haupt-Switch (geplant)\n\n- **Gerät:** Smart-Managed Switch (z.B. Zyxel XGS1210-12)\n    \n- **Schnittstellen:**\n    \n    - Mindestens 2x **2,5 Gbit/s** Ethernet Ports (RJ45)\n        \n    - Mehrere **1 Gbit/s** Ethernet Ports (RJ45)\n        \n    - (Optional) 2x **10 Gbit/s** SFP+ Ports (für zukünftige Erweiterungen)","x":-200,"y":-1760,"width":400,"height":320,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"4396efbfda4bb3b9","type":"text","text":"### Labor-Switch\n\n- **Gerät:** Cisco 2960 PoE 24 Switch\n    \n- **Schnittstellen:**\n    \n    - 24x **100 Mbit/s** Ethernet Ports (RJ45)\n        \n    - 2x **1 Gbit/s** Uplink Ports (RJ45)","x":-200,"y":-1000,"width":367,"height":200,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"e1c0d74344c0c8f9","type":"text","text":"### Proxmox Server\n\nhttps://192.168.178.50:8006/\n\n- **Gerät:** Lenovo ThinkCentre M70s Gen 4\n    \n- **Spezifikationen:**\n    \n    - CPU: Intel Core i7-13700\n        \n    - RAM: 32 GB (2x 16 GB) DDR4-3200\n        \n    - System-SSD: 1x 512 GB NVMe SSD\n        \n    - NAS-SSD: 2x 2 TB WD Red SA500 SATA SSDs (geplant)\n        \n- **Schnittstellen:**\n    \n    - 1x **2,5 Gbit/s** Ethernet Port (Intel I226-V Add-on-Karte) -> **Für Heimnetz/Management**\n        \n    - 1x **1 Gbit/s** Ethernet Port (Onboard) -> **Für CCNA-Labor**\n","x":-680,"y":-1540,"width":380,"height":420,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"1be7b271d4676c0c","type":"text","text":"###  Desktop PC\n\n- **Gerät:** Haupt-PC\n    \n- **Spezifikationen:**\n    \n    - CPU: AMD Ryzen 7 5800X3D\n        \n- **Schnittstellen:**\n    \n    - 1x **1 Gbit/s** Ethernet Port (Onboard) ->  **Für CCNA-Labor**\n        \n    - 1x **2,5 Gbit/s** Ethernet Port (RealTech Add-on-Karte) -> **Für Heimnetz**","x":310,"y":-1540,"width":370,"height":420,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"b2e30e517fcdc690","type":"text","text":"### Netzwerk 1: Heimnetz (Produktiv)\n\n* **IP-Adressbereich:** `192.168.178.0 / 24`\n* **Gateway / DNS:** `192.168.178.1` (Fritz!Box Cable)\n\n| Gerät               | Schnittstelle              | Geschwindigkeit | Verbunden mit         | IP-Adresse                           |\n| :------------------ | :------------------------- | :-------------- | :-------------------- | :----------------------------------- |\n| **AVM Fritz!Box**   | LAN 1 (WAN-Uplink)         | 2,5 Gbit/s      | Haupt-Switch (Port 1) | `192.168.178.1`                      |\n| **Haupt-Switch**    | Port 1 (Uplink)            | 2,5 Gbit/s      | Fritz!Box (LAN 1)     | (Management-IP z.B. `192.168.178.2`) |\n| **Proxmox Server**  | Intel I226-V NIC           | 2,5 Gbit/s      | Haupt-Switch (Port 2) | `192.168.178.50`                     |\n| **Desktop PC**      | TP-Link TX201 RealTech NIC | 2,5 Gbit/s      | Haupt-Switch (Port 3) | `192.168.178.20`                     |\n| **Fritz!Powerline** | Ethernet Port              | 1 Gbit/s        | Haupt-Switch (Port 4) | (bekommt IP via DHCP)                |\n\n\n---\n### Netzwerk 2: CCNA-Labor (Isoliert)\n\n* **IP-Adressbereich:** `10.10.10.0 / 24`\n* **Gateway / DNS:** Keins (isoliertes Netz)\n\n| Gerät                 | Schnittstelle        | Geschwindigkeit | Verbunden mit              | IP-Adresse              |\n| :-------------------- | :------------------- | :-------------- | :------------------------- | :---------------------- |\n| **Proxmox Server**    | Onboard-NIC          | 1 Gbit/s        | Cisco Switch (Port 24)     | (Keine IP auf dem Host) |\n| **Desktop PC**        | Onboard-NIC          | 1 Gbit/s        | Cisco Switch (Port 1)      | `10.10.10.1`            |\n| **Cisco Switch**      | Management Interface | 100 Mbit/s      | -                          | (z.B. `10.10.10.254`)   |\n| **VM 1 (in Proxmox)** | (an vmbr1)           | 1 Gbit/s        | Cisco Switch (z.B. Port 2) | `10.10.10.2`            |\n| **VM 2 (in Proxmox)** | (an vmbr1)           | 1 Gbit/s        | Cisco Switch (z.B. Port 3) | `10.10.10.3`            |\n","x":720,"y":-2020,"width":1025,"height":970,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"c57d5b8e1f6e0a93","type":"text","text":"### ## Proxmox VE (Host)\n\n- **Gerät:** Lenovo ThinkCentre M70s Gen 4\n    \n- **Hostname:** `pve`\n    \n- **Web-Oberfläche:** `https://192.168.178.50:8006`\n    \n- **Netzwerkbrücken:**\n    \n    - **vmbr0 (Heimnetz):**\n        \n        - **IP-Adresse:** `192.168.178.50`\n            \n        - **Physische Karte:** `enp2s0` (2,5 Gbit/s Intel I226-V)\n            \n    - **vmbr1 (CCNA-Labor):**\n        \n        - **IP-Adresse:** `10.10.10.253`\n            \n        - **Physische Karte:** `eno1` (1 Gbit/s Onboard)\n            \n        - **VLAN Aware:** Ja","x":-930,"y":-1360,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"68a64300f433d5d0","type":"text","text":"### ## Proxmox VE (Host)\n- **Hostname:** `pve` \n- **Web-Oberfläche:** `https://192.168.178.50:8006`\n- **Netzwerkbrücken:**\n    - **vmbr0 (Heimnetz):**\n        - **IP-Adresse:** `192.168.178.50`       \n        - **Physische Karte:** `enp2s0` (2,5 Gbit/s Intel I226-V)      \n    - **vmbr1 (CCNA-Labor):**\n        - **IP-Adresse:** `10.10.10.253`\n        - **Physische Karte:** `eno1` (1 Gbit/s Onboard)\n        - **VLAN Aware:** Ja","x":-1080,"y":-1540,"width":390,"height":420,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"2e64e9eea959f1ea","type":"text","text":"###  LXC Container: Pi-hole\n\nhttp://192.168.178.55/admin/\n- **Container ID:** `100`\n- **Hostname:** `pihole`\n- **Web-Oberfläche:** `http://192.168.178.55/admin`\n\n- **Netzwerk:**\n\n\t- **Angeschlossen an:** `vmbr0` (Heimnetz)\n    - **IPv4-Adresse:** `192.168.178.55`\n    - **IPv6-Adresse (ULA):** `fd4f:8ad3:d94b:0:be24:11ff:fe2d:e1f0`","x":-1050,"y":-2130,"width":330,"height":460,"color":"5"},
